            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Meeting Coach 0.8.3</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Your Progress now counts real weeks: "this week" starts Monday, compared against all of last week — no more rolling 7-day windows that read like wrong numbers</li>
  <li>Coach suggestion cards now say exactly what Apply will do ("waits 50% longer between nudges", "starts watching for this next call") instead of leaving you guessing</li>
</ul>
